{"text": "2. Then multiply: 5 × 4 = 20.", "start": 816, "end": 845, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "This also doesn't work.", "start": 847, "end": 870, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's try: (10 × (5 + 1)/5).", "start": 871, "end": 899, "label": "suggest"}
{"text": "1. First, calculate the addition inside the parentheses: 5 + 1 = 6.", "start": 901, "end": 968, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "2. Then the multiplication: 10 × 6 = 60.", "start": 969, "end": 1009, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "3. Finally, divide by 5: 60 div 5 = 12.", "start": 1010, "end": 1049, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "This doesn't give us 24 either.", "start": 1051, "end": 1082, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's try: (10 × (5 + 5)/1).", "start": 1083, "end": 1111, "label": "suggest"}
{"text": "1. Calculate the addition: 5 + 5 = 10.", "start": 1113, "end": 1151, "label": "inform"}
